{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_B962E341","title":"Ava explains Vending machines","entry":"Dlg_B962E341::entry","exit":"Dlg_B962E341::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_2ABA2548","articyId":"72057834556100552","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"I see you have discovered the exciting world of vending machines. Another lucrative business venture!","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I see you have discovered the exciting world of vending machines. Another lucrative business venture!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":425.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25768","byteOffset":17631912,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_0308DBB8","articyId":"72057834556100559","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"...Yeah?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"...Yeah?","TextSheVersion":"...Yeah?","TextTheyVersion":"...Yeah?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":725.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44094","byteOffset":31015976,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_4D3EC747","articyId":"72057834556100566","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"Vending machines are the past. But also the future! Your future.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Vending machines are the past. But also the future! Your future.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1025.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23740","byteOffset":16862472,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_EE292D04","articyId":"72057834556100573","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm not sure Ava.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not sure Ava.","TextSheVersion":"I'm not sure Ava.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm not sure Ava."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1325.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22219","byteOffset":16291344,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_8413C832","articyId":"72057834556100594","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Alright, I'm listening.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Alright, I'm listening.","TextSheVersion":"Alright, I'm listening.","TextTheyVersion":"Alright, I'm listening."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1325.0,"y":800.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36113","byteOffset":28009048,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_2C4B92DF","articyId":"72057834556100580","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"Vending machines are a cheap and easy way to accrue passive income. Passive income is a form of leeching money from others with minimal work! You just need money to begin with.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Vending machines are a cheap and easy way to accrue passive income. Passive income is a form of leeching money from others with minimal work! You just need money to begin with.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1625.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48262","byteOffset":32594736,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_99AB47D8","articyId":"72057834556100587","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"We don't HAVE money to begin with.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We don't HAVE money to begin with.","TextSheVersion":"We don't HAVE money to begin with.","TextTheyVersion":"We don't HAVE money to begin with."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1925.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37742","byteOffset":28615416,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_75F6F367","articyId":"72057834556100601","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"A vending machine license is expensive, but we have one! Inherited from our Thaddeus business portfolio. That's why you can already begin your vending adventure. Exciting!","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A vending machine license is expensive, but we have one! Inherited from our Thaddeus business portfolio. That's why you can already begin your vending adventure. Exciting!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2300.0,"y":800.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26759","byteOffset":18002256,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_98A749F3","articyId":"72057834556100609","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So, how do we do this?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So, how do we do this?","TextSheVersion":"So, how do we do this?","TextTheyVersion":"So, how do we do this?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2625.0,"y":800.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32251","byteOffset":20081176,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_74F8BF7E","articyId":"72057834556100623","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"I've already activated your vending machine license extension! When the time comes you will be able to buy, place and manage vending machines in suitable locations.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I've already activated your vending machine license extension! When the time comes you will be able to buy, place and manage vending machines in suitable locations.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2925.0,"y":800.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28426","byteOffset":18636448,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_92A71BDA","articyId":"72057834556100629","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"This is really going to make us money?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This is really going to make us money?","TextSheVersion":"This is really going to make us money?","TextTheyVersion":"This is really going to make us money?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3250.0,"y":800.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39589","byteOffset":29306544,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_15081A76","articyId":"72057834556100638","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"Assuredly! The influx of visitors and the travel restrictions from the LUZ has increased the demand for cheap, low quality food and drink. There is a gap in the market. A vending machine-shaped gap!","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Assuredly! The influx of visitors and the travel restrictions from the LUZ has increased the demand for cheap, low quality food and drink. There is a gap in the market. A vending machine-shaped gap!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3550.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51673","byteOffset":33963752,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_57407141","articyId":"72057834556100644","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Alright, let's do it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"Te